; Written by: 	Frank Hurley.
; Obtained from: 	The 1998 SSEM Programming Competition.
; Description: 	"The program is an animation of a giant baby and Tom chasing after each other for eternity underneath
;               a jumble of bulbs, switches, cables, smoke and iron. Viewable on store tube. The program does not
;               terminate and the animation cycles every 8 seconds @ 700 ips. Blurred vision helps."
; Parameter Lines: 	-
; Result Lines: 	(run-time display)

00 BNUM 00000110101001000100000100000100  ; Initial picture/control word used by the self-modifying animation.
01 LDN 25                                 ; ACC = -line25.
02 STO 1                                  ; Rewrite line 01 with the current image/control word.
03 CMP                                    ; If ACC is negative, skip the next line.
04 SUB 23                                 ; Apply the -1 constant when the compare does not skip.
05 SUB 1                                  ; Subtract the newly written control word in line 01.
06 SUB 1                                  ; Subtract line 01 again.
07 SUB 1                                  ; Subtract line 01 a third time.
08 STO 25                                 ; Store the updated picture/control word back to line 25.
09 LDN 21                                 ; ACC = -line21.
10 CMP                                    ; If ACC is negative, skip the next line.
11 SUB 22                                 ; Otherwise subtract line 22.
12 SUB 23                                 ; Subtract the -1 constant.
13 STO 21                                 ; Update line 21 with the new control/state value.
14 SUB 5                                  ; Combine the current state with line 05.
15 STO 8                                  ; Rewrite line 08, another self-modifying animation step.
16 SUB 0                                  ; Subtract line 00 to fold in the base image/control word.
17 STO 1                                  ; Rewrite line 01 again with the new state.
18 LDN 21                                 ; ACC = -line21.
19 STO 21                                 ; Negate/toggle the state word in line 21.
20 JMP 24                                 ; Branch via line 24 back to the start of the animation loop.
21 BNUM 01100000000000000000000000000000  ; Constant/state word = 6.
22 BNUM 11100000000000000000000000000000  ; Constant/state word = 7.
23 BNUM 11111111111111111111111111111111  ; Constant -1.
24 BNUM 00000000000000000000000000000000  ; Encoded jump target used by line 20 to restart at line 01.
25 BNUM 00000000000000011111000000100000  ; Picture/control word manipulated by lines 01-08.
26 BNUM 00000000000000100000100001010000  ; Static display data word.
27 BNUM 00000000000000100010100000100000  ; Static display data word.
28 BNUM 00000001111110100000100000111000  ; Static display data word.
29 BNUM 00000010000000011111000000100000  ; Static display data word.
30 BNUM 00011110011110001000000000100000  ; Static display data word.
31 BNUM 00111111111111111110000001010000  ; Static display data word.
